                                            {
                                                "example_id": "381db929-b388-4015-89f0-696f309a6360",
                                                "sense_id": "1543d7d3-4547-3a4c-bdf2-933b3ddeb9c6",
                                                "text": "[…] she was as the wild yoncopin to the calla lily. Marjie knew how to dress. To-day, shaded by the buggy-top, in her dainty light blue lawn, with the soft pink of her cheeks and her clear white brow and throat, she was a most delicious thing […]"
